cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
title: "RFieldMesh: Reproducible spatial random fields for finite-element meshes"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-07-25
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  RFieldMesh generates reproducible spatial random fields and assigns them
  safely to finite-element models through a Python API, command-line
  interface, and desktop application.
keywords:
  - random fields
  - finite-element method
  - geotechnical engineering
  - spatial variability
  - uncertainty quantification
  - Abaqus
authors:
